Task 01: Repository Setup GuideBranch Protection Rules
Go to your GitHub repository settings under Branches and turn on these rules for main and develop:Require a pull request before merging: At least 1 person must review and approve the code.Require status checks: Automated builds and tests must pass before merging.Require conversation resolution: All review comments must be addressed.Include administrators: Apply these rules to admins too.Prevent force pushes: Block force pushes to protect commit history.Prevent deletions: Stop anyone from accidentally deleting the branch.Pull Request Template
